      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "1. Functional Requirements\n-  Collect data/event (Cpu, Ram, disk etc)\n-  Store information\n- Dashboard UI\n- Creating the Alerts\n- Create update the rules",
      "fontSize": 28.914285714285676,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "1. Functional Requirements\n-  Collect data/event (Cpu, Ram, disk etc)\n-  Store information\n- Dashboard UI\n- Creating the Alerts\n- Create update the rules",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
    {
